  "title": "Personal planning comparison",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Personal planning comparison</h2><p>Compare two investments and compute a gift under the supplied assumptions.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m1-tbs3-f1\">Taxable bond after-tax yield, percent</label><input id=\"tcp-m1-tbs3-f1\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m1-tbs3-f2\">Higher stated after-tax yield</label><select id=\"tcp-m1-tbs3-f2\"><option value=\"Tax-exempt bond\">Tax-exempt bond</option><option value=\"Taxable bond\">Taxable bond</option><option value=\"Exactly equal\">Exactly equal</option><option value=\"Cannot compare the supplied equal-risk assumptions\">Cannot compare the supplied equal-risk assumptions</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m1-tbs3-f3\">Taxable gift before unified credit</label><input id=\"tcp-m1-tbs3-f3\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m1-tbs3-f4\">Does that taxable gift alone establish current tax payable?</label><select id=\"tcp-m1-tbs3-f4\"><option value=\"No; evaluate available credit and other rules\">No; evaluate available credit and other rules</option><option value=\"Yes, the gift amount is the tax\">Yes, the gift amount is the tax</option><option value=\"Yes, the recipient owes wage tax\">Yes, the recipient owes wage tax</option><option value=\"No transfer reporting can ever apply\">No transfer reporting can ever apply</option></select></div></section>",
