  "explanation": "<h3>Taxable bond after-tax yield, percent</h3><p>7% × 70% = 4.9%.</p><h3>Higher stated after-tax yield</h3><p>The tax-exempt yield is 5%, above 4.9%.</p><h3>Taxable gift before unified credit</h3><p>$70,000 − $19,000 = $51,000.</p><h3>Does that taxable gift alone establish current tax payable?</h3><p>Taxable gift and tax payable are separate.</p>"
